-- file's own variant of its name: as for a program module's trait, the
-- help offers the call through the module, `json.Encode.encode(x)`, which
-- compiles (audit R9, review rv-o8 S3).
-- stderr-contains: help: `Encode` here is the variant `T.Encode`, which hides the trait `Encode` in expressions: call it as `json.Encode.encode(x)`
-- stderr-contains: help: `encode` is a method of trait `Encode`: call it as `json.Encode.encode(x)`
